  (text "Commander numpad module (rev N0) - one of the two sliding-tray modules (NUMPAD_MODULE of the chassis model,\n131 x 68 mm).  A USB HID keyboard (keypad page) on its own USB-C, so it also works on any other computer.\nSame microcontroller and USB circuit as the keyboard (STC8H8K64U at 5 V, crystal-less USB, STC USB boot loader):\none part list, one firmware tool chain.  Firmware is new - pin table in README.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
